{"suttaId":"tha-ap108","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5251,5272],"vripara":"29"},"segments":{"tha-ap108:0.3":"Udakapūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap108:1.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ,","tha-ap108:1.2":"gacchantaṃ anilañjase;","tha-ap108:1.3":"Ghatāsanaṃva jalitaṃ,","tha-ap108:1.4":"ādittaṃva hutāsanaṃ.","tha-ap108:2.1":"“Pāṇinā udakaṃ gayha,","tha-ap108:2.2":"ākāse ukkhipiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap108:2.3":"Sampaṭicchi mahāvīro,","tha-ap108:2.4":"buddho kāruṇiko isi [mayi (syā.)].","tha-ap108:3.1":"“Antalikkhe ṭhito satthā,","tha-ap108:3.2":"padumuttaranāmako;","tha-ap108:3.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya,","tha-ap108:3.4":"imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsatha.","tha-ap108:4.1":"“‘Iminā dakadānena,","tha-ap108:4.2":"pītiuppādanena ca;","tha-ap108:4.3":"Kappasatasahassampi,","tha-ap108:4.4":"duggatiṃ nupapajjati’[nupapajjasi (ka.)].","tha-ap108:5.1":"“Tena kammena dvipadinda,","tha-ap108:5.2":"lokajeṭṭha narāsabha;","tha-ap108:5.3":"Pattomhi acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ,","tha-ap108:5.4":"hitvā jayaparājayaṃ.","tha-ap108:6.1":"“Sahassarājanāmena,","tha-ap108:6.2":"tayo te cakkavattino;","tha-ap108:6.3":"Pañcasaṭṭhikappasate,","tha-ap108:6.4":"cāturantā janādhipā.","tha-ap108:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap108:7.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap108:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā udakapūjako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap108:9.1":"Udakapūjakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2821,"to":2821,"paras":[{"para":2821,"vripara":"29","refs":["tha-ap108:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhan</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttameva.","<b>Ghatāsanaṃva jalitan</b>ti ghataṃ vuccati sappi, ghatassa āsanaṃ ādhāranti ghatāsanaṃ, aggi, atha vā taṃ asati bhuñjatīti ghatāsanaṃ, aggiyeva.","Yathā ghate āsitte aggimhi aggisikhā atīva jalati, evaṃ aggikkhandhaṃ iva jalamānaṃ bhagavantanti attho.","<b>Ādittaṃva hutāsanan</b>ti hutaṃ vuccati pūjāsakkāre, hutassa pūjāsakkārassa āsananti hutāsanaṃ, jalamānaṃ sūriyaṃ iva dvattiṃsamahāpurisalakkhaṇehi byāmappabhāmaṇḍalehi vijjotamānaṃ suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ <b>anilañjase</b> ākāse gacchantaṃ addasanti sambandho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap108:1"],["tha-ap108:1"],["tha-ap108:1"],["tha-ap108:1"],["tha-ap108:1"],["tha-ap108:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap108:1.1","suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ",0,0],["tha-ap108:1.3","ghatāsanaṃva jalitaṃ",0,2],["tha-ap108:1.1","anilañjase",0,4],["tha-ap108:1.3","ādittaṃva hutāsanaṃ",0,4]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
